\item \code{janitor}: remove empty columns from comparison workbooks.
\item \code{here}: locate the user's project and default output folder.
\item \code{jsonlite}: read the remote survey-file listing.
\item \code{readr}: CSV downloads of long-format results.
\item \code{later}: schedule application UI updates.
